      Takeaways

The lowercase letter l and the number 1 can look similar, so I should check carefully when typing <ul>.
To make an image clickable, I can place the <img> element inside an <a> element.
Indenting code does not create a nested list; I need to put a new list inside a list item.
Asking for help and testing code in JSBin helped me solve problems.

Making HTML is fun, and I’m excited to learn about CSS.
